<content>
  <section><title>Warm Up Activity</title>
<para>A cannon is 10 feet off the ground. It launches a cannonball straight up with a velocity of 406 feet per second.</para>
<para>Imagine that there is no gravity and that the cannonball continues to travel upward with the same velocity.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
